### One Finance UX POC - sample requests
### Works with the IntelliJ HTTP Client and the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
@hub = http://localhost:8080
@sim = http://localhost:8081
@cob = 2026-09-10

### 1. A source publishes one event (202 ACCEPTED; sending it again returns 200 DUPLICATE)
POST {{hub}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "MOTIF-MB001-{{cob}}",
  "eventType": "MASTERBOOK_READY",
  "sourceSystem": "MOTIF",
  "sourceKey": "MB001",
  "cobDate": "{{cob}}",
  "region": "GLOBAL",
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### 2. A batch failure: 15C3 goes BLOCKED and US Regulatory Reporting is alerted
POST {{hub}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "USCASTLE_COMPLETE",
  "sourceSystem": "USCASTLE",
  "sourceKey": "BATCH-03",
  "cobDate": "{{cob}}",
  "region": "AMRS",
  "status": "FAILED",
  "attributes": { "reason": "Upstream position file truncated" }
}

### 3. A restatement: SAP withdraws a completed trial balance (every dependent outcome loses readiness)
POST {{hub}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "SAP_TB_COMPLETE",
  "sourceSystem": "SAP",
  "sourceKey": "CC-4430",
  "cobDate": "{{cob}}",
  "region": "AMRS",
  "status": "REVOKED",
  "attributes": { "reason": "Late journal posted" }
}

### 4. Several events in one call
POST {{hub}}/api/events/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "eventType": "GMIS_LOADED", "sourceSystem": "GMIS", "sourceKey": "BK-RATES", "cobDate": "{{cob}}", "region": "AMRS", "status": "COMPLETED" },
  { "eventType": "RAM_CHORUS_READY", "sourceSystem": "RAM", "sourceKey": "CG-RATES", "cobDate": "{{cob}}", "region": "AMRS", "status": "COMPLETED" }
]

### 5. Invalid event (400 ProblemDetail naming the missing fields)
POST {{hub}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventType": "SAP_TB_COMPLETE", "sourceSystem": "SAP", "cobDate": "{{cob}}", "status": "COMPLETED" }

### 6. Business outcome answers (the "Can I...?" questions)
GET {{hub}}/api/outcomes

### 7. One outcome in detail
GET {{hub}}/api/outcomes/REPORT_15C3/{{cob}}/AMRS

### 8. Manual override of a blocked or late input (human in the loop, reason is mandatory and audited)
POST {{hub}}/api/outcomes/REPORT_15C3/{{cob}}/AMRS/override
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dependency": "USCASTLE_COMPLETE", "reason": "Batch verified manually with US Castle support, INC0042", "requestedBy": "controller.jsmith" }

### 9. Re-run the downstream action of a READY or COMPLETED outcome
POST {{hub}}/api/outcomes/FOBO_HELIX/{{cob}}/GLOBAL/run
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requestedBy": "controller.jsmith" }

### 10. Notifications and the event tape
GET {{hub}}/api/notifications?limit=50

###
GET {{hub}}/api/events?limit=100

### 11. Live stream (Server-Sent Events) - open in a browser or: curl -N http://localhost:8080/api/stream
GET {{hub}}/api/stream
Accept: text/event-stream

### 12. Loaded configuration (outcomes, translation mappings, action targets)
GET {{hub}}/api/config

### ---------------- Source simulator ----------------

### List scenarios
GET {{sim}}/sim/scenarios

### Helix / FOBO: 300 master books over 45 seconds
POST {{sim}}/sim/scenarios/helix?masterBooks=300&seconds=45

### 15C3 happy path
POST {{sim}}/sim/scenarios/15c3

### 15C3 with a US Castle batch failure and recovery
POST {{sim}}/sim/scenarios/15c3?failure=true

### PnL slow drip (goes at risk, then breaches its SLA)
POST {{sim}}/sim/scenarios/pnl

### SAP trial balance restatement (run after 15C3 completes)
POST {{sim}}/sim/scenarios/restate

### Everything at once
POST {{sim}}/sim/scenarios/all

### Stop running scenarios
POST {{sim}}/sim/scenarios/cancel

### Reset the hub (clears events, outcomes, notifications)
POST {{hub}}/api/admin/reset
